atus/2120229920731480412"}, {"author_id": "1800683759165173760", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:36:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119952357450723349"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "NVDA"}]}, "id": "2119952357450723349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 69, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$NVDA: The IPO is a test of compute utilization, not a GPU order.\n\nNVIDIA is part of Anthropic’s compute strategy, but the IPO is not a simple one-directional NVIDIA catalyst.\n\nThe 2025 partnership announced up to $10B of NVIDIA investment and an initial plan for up to one", "url": "https://x.com/wisehw25/status/2119952357450723349"}, {"author_id": "14333690", "created_at": "2026-11-10T11:59:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120124155135733950"], "id": "2120124155135733950", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 364, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Cloud AI Capacity Panic Is Creating Bad Enterprise Decisions\n\nThe current conversation around cloud capacity is getting out of hand.\n\nYes, AI infrastructure demand is real. GPU capacity is tight. Power, data center space, specialized hardware, and long-term reservations all", "url": "https://x.com/DavidLinthicum/status/2120124155135733950"}, {"author_id": "1557555903611944960", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:40:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119968317238849680"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/MHUncleRay/sta…", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MHUncleRay/status/2119961145046192440?a=41BskuX10Ry2Y6fNUXU&s=20", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/9SEUMJDsZ0"}]}, "id": "2119968317238849680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 122, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119961145046192440", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The AI indu